    <IntentSummary>Harden the existing CI, QA and owner-run Worker delivery lanes against the six confirmed audit gaps while preserving the signed release boundary.</IntentSummary>
    <ApprovalBasis>The owner's 2026-11-09 instruction delegated the approach and execution of the supplied audit fixes.</ApprovalBasis>
