    <ImplementationPlan>
      <T-001><Title>Repair unsigned QA packaging and Windows command failures</Title><DependsOn/><AcceptanceCriteria><Criterion>QA packaging omits signed updater artifacts and each verification command has its own fail-fast step.</Criterion></AcceptanceCriteria><Verification><Command>npx vitest run tests/renderer/release-github-controls.test.js</Command></Verification></T-001>
      <T-002><Title>Repair docs-only classification, complete PR gating and remove duplicate WebKit execution</Title><DependsOn/><AcceptanceCriteria><Criterion>Classification has a checkout and read permission; mixed code/documentation changes run the full suite, the required aggregate gates IPC types, and the two WebKit projects run once with screenshot upload retained.</Criterion></AcceptanceCriteria><Verification><Command>npm run typecheck:ipc</Command></Verification></T-002>
      <T-003><Title>Pin Rust and executable Actions inputs</Title><DependsOn/><AcceptanceCriteria><Criterion>All affected CI and packaging jobs select Rust 1.99.0 and immutable action commits with version-sensitive caches.</Criterion></AcceptanceCriteria><Verification><Command>go run github.com/rhysd/actionlint/cmd/actionlint@v1.7.12 -shellcheck=</Command></Verification></T-003>
      <T-004><Title>Bind Worker deploy to a checked SHA</Title><DependsOn/><AcceptanceCriteria><Criterion>Deploy preflight refuses dirty, stale and unverified candidates and the runbook records deployed identity and route checks.</Criterion></AcceptanceCriteria><Verification><Command>npx vitest run tests/tools/stats-gateway-deploy.test.mjs</Command></Verification></T-004>
      <T-005><Title>Synchronize GRACE and verify candidate</Title><DependsOn>T-001, T-002, T-003, T-004</DependsOn><AcceptanceCriteria><Criterion>Module maps and routed graph and verification evidence match source, GRACE final and current integrity pass, and no release or deploy occurs.</Criterion></AcceptanceCriteria><Verification><Command>npx vitest run tests/renderer/release-github-controls.test.js tests/tools/stats-gateway-deploy.test.mjs</Command></Verification></T-005>
    </ImplementationPlan>
  </C-CI-CD-AUDIT-FIXES>
